apex legends emergence is right around  the corner season 10 of respawns battle  royale introduces a new playable legend  in the form of seer  makes substantial changes to world's  edge and implements major balance and  changes to several weapons and  characters  over the course of this video we'll go  through everything you need to know  including the new law and abilities for  seer info on the three maps coming to  arenas  the rampage lmg and the return of the  disrupter ammo  first up when can we expect to play apex  legends emergence well you won't have to  wait long it's scheduled to begin on  august the 3rd  which follows the conclusion of the  limited time thrill seekers event as it  stands respawn hasn't yet released the  patch notes for the emergence update  but if the studio sticks to the pattern  of past seasons though we can expect to  get them the day before the new season  starts  which would be obviously august 2nd  season 10 introduces apex legends 18th  playable character  obi aka sia sia is a recon character and  his ability kit makes him more of a  tracker like bloodhound than the more  scout-like pathfinder crypto and  valkyrie  he is geared towards hunting down enemy  squads in close quarters  in terms of sears abilities his passive  is heartseeker the skill  allows sia to hear the heartbeat of  enemy legends while aiming down sights  which naturally helps them discover  their location his tactical ability is  focus of attention which gives seer the  ability to release several mini drones  and after a short delay they can mark  all enemies in front of him  interrupting their use of healing items  and revives and revealing vital  information like their location and  health to see and his allies  for eight seconds lastly his ultimate  ability is exhibit  which has sia throw out his heart  chamber which releases hundreds of mini  drones that form a sphere  enemies that move too quickly or fire  the weapons in the sphere become marked  revealing their location to see and his  allies enemies can destroy sierra's  heart chamber by shooting it  in a similar manner to stopping crypto  and horizon's ultimate abilities  in terms of law sierra has a complicated  history one informed by an old  folk tale called the moth and the flame  the folk tale foretells a prophecy that  a cursed moth will be reborn as a human  child  a child who will blindly lead humanity  to its destruction  azir was born with glowing eyes and to a  mother with a moth tattoo and on a day  when a fiery meteor destroyed his  planet's moon  those around him in his community  believed him to be this foretold  cursed child he was shunned but his  father taught him how to command  a fleet of minidrones and his mother  gifted him with dance and an  appreciation for art  sia took their lessons and developed a  mesmerizingly elegant but brutal  fighting style  that combined the two earning him nine  years of accolades in the underground  arenas  his fame got him a place in the new apex  games  emergence introduces a number of buffs  and nerfs to existing legends too  first up caustic receives a buff which  sees his gas damage increase  every other second with no limit on how  much it can increase and the gas cloud  created from caustics knox gas grenade  dissipates five seconds sooner  horizon also sees a buff which sees her  gravity lift maneuver adjusted to be  closer to how it was in season seven  lastly on the buff side of things fuse's  knuckle cluster move  will now last twice as long allowing him  to deny areas for longer and then  enemies caught in the mother lode will  be highlighted making it easier for fuse  and his allies to plan their follow-up  attack  on the nerve side of things enemies will  now get an audible and visual indication  when death totem's death protection is  about to end  letting them know that revenant and his  allies are about to be vulnerable  hammond's continued efforts to mine  talos for its natural resources will  decimate world's edge at the start of  emergence  the lava crack caused by the harvester  lengthens and the destruction extends to  touch both the southern and northern  parts of the map  sorting factory is completely destroyed  falling into a sinkhole  this landmark will be replaced by a new  point of interest lava siphon  the destruction causes a landslide to  the nearby mountains burying train yard  and debris  and transforming it into the new poi  called landslide  most of the changes can be seen in the  north refinery will be completely wiped  out replaced by climatizer a  significantly larger point of interest  nearby a new lava crack is opened up  though it won't provide a heated updraft  like the one that cuts through the  middle of world's edge  and though it's not a point of interest  a new giant dam will be constructed  between climatizer and epicenter  to prevent the lava from spilling into  the rest of world's edge at both  climatizer and lava siphon  moving gondolas will be added to the map  providing movable cover for squads in a  similar capacity to the train  that once moved through world's edge in  seasons three to five  during season 10 the arenas maps based  on existing kings canyon world's edge  and olympus landmarks  are being rotated out so no more playing  arenas and artillery thermal station  gardens  in their place three new landmark based  arenas are rotating in king's canyon's  hillside  world's edges dome and olympus's oasis  these three maps will exist in the  arena's playlist rotation alongside  phase runner party crasher  and overflow emergence adds the rampage  to ground loop  a brand new heavy ammo lmg the rampage  sets itself apart from any other lmg by  being slower but more powerful variation  of the spitfire  making it an ideal mid-range weapon  similar to the weapons like the 30 30  repeater and bosek compound bow the  rampage doesn't fire fast enough to be  much of a threat at close range  and similar to the sentinel sniper rifle  the rampage can be charged but instead  of using shield cells the rampage takes  through my grenades once charged the  rampage fires much  more quickly making it a decent close  range threat  and allowing it to also easily destroy  doors similar to grenades  at the start of emergence the prowler  will rotate out the care packages and  once again become a ground loop weapon  however the gun will only have a burst  fire mode and you won't be able to  switch it to automatic fire in its place  both the spitfire and alternator are  rotating into care packages  in care packages the spitfire will  revert to its pre-nerfed state and the  alternator will automatically come  equipped with disrupter rounds  because of these care package  adjustments in arenas you'll be able to  buy the prowler and no longer be able to  purchase the alternator or spitfire in  terms of hop-ups both the anvil receiver  and quick draw will be removed from the  game at the start of emergence  the traits of quick draw will  automatically be implemented into  pistols  though to a lesser degree in their place  apex legends is getting a brand new  hop-up  the boosted loader this hop-up goes on  the hemlock and wingman changing the  guns so that they reload faster  and get bonus ammo if reloaded at the  right time similar to deadeye's tempo  it's a timing based hop-up emergence  will also change the l-star  the lmg will now also take barrel  stabilizers and extended energy  magazines  high level energy mags will increase the  time it takes for the l-star to overheat  and cause it to cool faster when it does  and speaking of speed the fire rates for  the eva 8 when it has  shotgun bolts equipped is being nerfed  additionally reload speed will also no  longer  be tied to extended magazines starting  in season 10.  instead that trait will now be tied to  the standard stocks and sniper stocks  and speaking of sniper stocks marksman  rifles will start taking  sniper stocks in season 10 as opposed to  the standard ones  ranked arenas is also coming to apex  legends in season 10.  these arenas will exist on a wholly  separate playlist  when season 10 starts you'll have to  play 10 ranked arenas matches to figure  out where you'll be placed  there is also no penalty to ranked  arenas at the higher ranks  you don't earn points based on how many  kills and assists you get either  you simply gain points for winning and  losing points for losing  the arena's rank will exist separately  to your battle royale rank  like previous seasons emergence adds a  new battle pass that includes over 100  cosmetic rewards  including two legendary character skins  and two legendary reactive weapon skins  this time around valkyrie and horizon  are getting the new legendary character  skins and the volt smg is getting the  legendary reactive weapon skin  and that is it if you're a fan of apex  legends make sure to like the video  and to subscribe to the channel for more  apex legends emergence  thank you so much for watching  [Music]  [Music]  you
 

